                the_scope_defaults_to_the_whole_project each 1 passed; cargo test -p akr-mcp --test differential
                a_handoff_opens_the_same_way_from_either_surface 1 passed; python3 tools/check-design.py
                exits 0 with "All checks passed".

                The scope path docs/17-advisor-packets.md was corrected to docs/17-handoff.md, which is the
                file that exists. That dead scope was invisible until the same session's fix to
                freshness::unmatched_watches extended AKR-G023 to completed records, and it is the reason
                this record was found at all: the tool's own ledger held a completed record whose every gate
                was vacuous and whose scope named a deleted file.

