record akr.evidence.repairable-ledger-write-pipeline/1 : evidence {
    title "29 tests pass, including the three that hold D-039: a write into a ledger carrying a pre-existing AKR-T023 lands and reports the fault it inherited as a note; a write that would introduce a scratch citation is refused with only its own diagnostic named and every source file byte-identical; and one of two inherited faults is repairable on its own, the note counting down from 2 to 1."
    state verified
